✔ MT760 received successfully.

✔ Received Undertaking created.

✔ Correct sender (Issuing/Advising Bank).

✔ Correct beneficiary.

✔ Correct workflow (ADVI/ACNF).

✔ Correct routing (0, 1, or 2 banks).

✔ Charges calculated correctly.

